  "hero_summary_zh": "痛苦女王的出手占尽先机，成群的敌人将在震耳欲聋的尖叫声中遭到毁灭。就算在猛攻中生还，敌人在逃生过程中还将被投掷的匕首减速，最终交出他的小命。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Queen of Pain strikes without warning, destroying gathered foes with deafening screams. Should an enemy survive her onslaught, she slows their escape with a throw of her dagger before finishing them off.",
