    {
      "name": "queenofpain_scream_of_pain",
      "id": 5175,
      "name_zh": "痛苦尖叫",
      "name_en": "Scream Of Pain",
      "description_zh": "痛苦女王发出刺耳的尖叫，对周围敌人造成伤害。造成伤害的%damage_reflected_to_self%%%会反弹回她身上。",
      "description_en": "The Queen of Pain lets loose a piercing scream around her, damaging nearby enemies.%damage_reflected_to_self%%% of the damage dealt to heroes is reflected back to her.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "痛苦尖叫能作用隐身单位。",
        "痛苦尖叫无法被躲避。",
        "对幻象造成的伤害不会反弹。反弹的伤害为减免前的，而且不致死。",
        "反弹伤害不提供任何吸血，而且无法反弹。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "Scream Of Pain will hit invisible units.",
        "Scream Of Pain cannot be disjointed.",
        "Damage to illusions is not reflected. Damage reflected is before reduction and non-lethal.",
        "Reflected damage does not provide any lifesteal and cannot be reflected."
      ],
